<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110581" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φερν-ή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέρω</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is brought by the wife, dowry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				47
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				629
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.5.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				218.65
			</span></i> (Ilium, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεραποντὶς φ.</span>
			<i>a dowry</i> of handmaids, i.e. <i>given as a dowry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				979
			</span></i> (anap.); pl., of <i>a dower,</i> as consisting of divers
			presents, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1662
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anaxandr.
				41.23
			</span></i> (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φερναὶ πολέμου,</span>
			of a wife won in battle, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				298
			</span></i>; also, <i>bridal gifts,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάζυσθε φ. τάσδε, παῖδες,</span> of
			Medea's presents to Creüsa, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Med.</u>
				956
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φερνά</span></b> , <i>portion</i> of
			victim reserved for the God, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				42(1).40.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				41.7
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">v/iv B. C.</span>).</div>
